      "content": "Please know that the silence you're feeling is a reflection of the immense void his absence has left, and it's completely understandable that it hurts. This profound emptiness is a heavy weight, and you don't have to figure out what to do with your hands or your life right now. Allow yourself the grace to simply exist in this overwhelming grief, and consider reaching out to a grief counselor or a support group for guidance.",
